# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your Google Gemini API key.
# Get one free at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# You can also paste the key directly into the app's Settings panel at runtime
# (it will be remembered in your browser's localStorage). The .env value is just
# a convenient default so you don't have to type it every time.

VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
